      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW IOWA (3) has a big motor and ideally suited at the longer trips. Was fifth last time (29.88) over 515m at Sandown in a Special conditions H but is better suited by the longer journey. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Worth another chance. ASTON MACHINE (7) could manage only second last time but ran strong time (29.41) at Sandown over 515m when beaten half a length in a Special conditions H. Expected to feature again. MOONLIGHT MILLER (1) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, most recently finishing 2nd at this track over 600m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Bold showing expected. WHITE MOCHA (2) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
